OL,3,CBarack Obama to return to UK with
OL,4,Cseries of live interview shows
OL,6,FFormer US president Barack Obama is to
OL,7,Ftour the UK in a series of on-stage
OL,8,Finterviews.
OL,10,FThe 64-year-old, who became the first
OL,11,Fblack president of the United States
OL,12,Fin 2009, will take An Evening With
OL,13,FPresident Barack Obama to Belfast,
OL,14,FGlasgow and Manchester, following
OL,15,Fshows at The O2 in London and the
OL,16,F3Arena in Dublin last year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
