OL,3,CBarack Obama to return to UK with
OL,4,Cseries of live interview shows
OL,6,FThe 44th US president will appear at
OL,7,FThe O2 in Belfast on October 13,
OL,8,FGlasgow's Ovo Hydro on October 14 and
OL,9,FManchester's Co-op Live on October 15,
OL,10,Fwith guest moderators to be announced.
OL,12,FOrganisers said Mr Obama will speak
OL,13,Fabout "what comes next for America,
OL,14,Fand for all of us" in the live
OL,15,Finterview format.
