OL,3,CBarack Obama to return to UK with
OL,4,Cseries of live interview shows
OL,6,FRobin Sherry, founder and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of organiser Seat Unique,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Following the phenomenal
OL,9,Fresponse to last year's events, we are
OL,10,Fdelighted to bring three new
OL,11,Fopportunities for fans to experience
OL,12,FAn Evening With President Barack
OL,13,FObama."
OL,15,FMr Obama was interviewed by British TV
OL,16,Fhistorian David Olusoga at The O2 in
OL,17,FLondon in September.
