OL,3,CBarack Obama to return to UK with
OL,4,Cseries of live interview shows
OL,6,FAfter his two-term presidency ended in
OL,7,F2017, Mr Obama and his wife, Michelle,
OL,8,Fsigned a deal with Netflix to produce
OL,9,Fdocumentaries, series and features for
OL,10,Fthe streaming platform under their
OL,11,FHigher Ground Productions company.
OL,13,FIn 2022, Mr Obama won the Emmy for
OL,14,Fbest narrator for his work on Netflix
OL,15,Fdocumentary series Our Great National
OL,16,FParks, and he has won Grammy Awards
OL,17,Ffor his audiobook readings of two of
OL,18,Fhis memoirs: The Audacity Of Hope and
OL,19,FDreams From My Father.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
