OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785111491
OL,3,CBarack Obama to return to UK with
OL,4,Cseries of live interview shows
OL,6,FThe Hawaii-born former president has
OL,7,Falso hosted a 2021 podcast called
OL,8,FRenegades: Born In The USA, alongside
OL,9,Frock singer Bruce Springsteen, which
OL,10,Falso resulted in a book.
OL,12,FTickets for the UK shows will go on
OL,13,Fsale on Friday July 31 at 10am from
OL,14,FMyticket.co.uk and SeatUnique.com,
OL,15,Fwith 100 tickets set aside for
OL,16,Fcharitable organisations.
